    .string "quasiquote"
.L16404:
    .string "special-form"
.L16405:
    .string "`data  ,expr  ,@list"
.L16406:
    .string "A list built from constant data, with `,e` inserting a value and `,@e` splicing a list. A bare name inside is E_MALFORMED_FORM. Macro templates are plain forms, not quasiquotes."
